      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاحِمٌ</span></b>  One <i>who feeds men with fat.</i> (S, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And A man <i>having,</i> or <i>possessing, fat;</i> like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاحِمٌ</span> signifying “ having, or possessing, flesh: ”
possessive epithets like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَابِنٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَامِرٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
